    The description "Yao Bin was the coach of Zhao Hongbo" clearly indicates a coach-athlete relationship. In such relationships, the coach (Yao Bin) directs, instructs, and manages the athlete (Zhao Hongbo). The athlete directly follows the coach's instructions and reports on progress. This aligns perfectly with the definition of `SUBORDINATE_OF`, particularly the "directly reports to" and "under their jurisdiction" aspects, and the explicit inclusion of "master-apprentice" as an example.

